# DS4001: what the engine cannot do, at the place it is used.
mode: check
schema: 'x.csv'(a: long, s: string); 'y.csv'(a: long); 'z.parquet'(a: long)
without: function strlen, join fullouter, format parquet
---- query
from 'x.csv' | where strlen(s) > 1 | join kind=fullouter 'y.csv' on a;
from 'z.parquet' | take 1;
from read_parquet('z.parquet') | take 1
---- expected
error[DS4001]: function `strlen` is not supported by this engine
  --> query:1:22
  |
1 | from 'x.csv' | where strlen(s) > 1 | join kind=fullouter 'y.csv' on a;
  |                      ^^^^^^ this engine does not implement it
  |
  = note: the function is part of DataScript, but the engine that runs this program cannot run it

error[DS4001]: `fullouter` joins are not supported by this engine
  --> query:1:48
  |
1 | from 'x.csv' | where strlen(s) > 1 | join kind=fullouter 'y.csv' on a;
  |                                                ^^^^^^^^^ this engine does not implement this kind of join

error[DS4001]: this engine cannot read parquet files
  --> query:2:6
  |
2 | from 'z.parquet' | take 1;
  |      ^^^^^^^^^^^ a parquet source
  |
  = note: this engine reads: csv, json, ndjson, tsv

error[DS4001]: this engine cannot read parquet files
  --> query:3:6
  |
3 | from read_parquet('z.parquet') | take 1
  |      ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ a parquet source
  |
  = note: this engine reads: csv, json, ndjson, tsv
